  "benefits": "<br>\n\n**Component**\t**Standard of Assistance****Minimum Time Limit (in Years) for Reclaiming Constituent Benefits**Managerial assistance to appoint VeterinarianThe Beneficiary Panjarapol Institute will pay ₹45,000/- per month to the appointed Veterinarian of which 75% will be paid to the Beneficiary Institute as a maximum of ₹33,750/- per month as subsidy.3 Year<br>\n\n",
