  "detailed_description": "The &amp;quot;Managerial Assistance Scheme for Appointment of Veterinarian&amp;quot;  launched by the Department of Agriculture, Farmers Welfare &amp;amp; Co-operation, Government of Gujarat, aims to encourage Panjrapols to maintain animal health by appointing veterinarians who will provide medical services, artificial insemination (AI), and vaccinations. The scheme also promotes scientific guidance and technical record maintenance.\n&lt;br&gt;\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n1. Panjrapol must be registered under the Charity Act.\n1. The Panjrapol must be maintaining more than 2000 animals.\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
